OL,3,GNEWSAFactory worker still passionate
OL,4,Aabout making pies after 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pie-maker said she is still
OL,7,Fpassionate about making pies after 40
OL,8,Fyears.
OL,10,FGina Goldsmith started working at
OL,11,FHolland's Pies near Accrington at 28
OL,12,Fand now leads a production line at the
OL,13,Ffactory.
OL,15,FThe company is celebrating its 175th
OL,16,Fbirthday this year and makes between
OL,17,F800,000 and 900,000 pies, pastries and
OL,18,Fpuddings a week.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
