OL,3,GNEWSAFactory worker still passionate
OL,4,Aabout making pies after 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Degenhart, general manager at
OL,7,FHolland's Pies, said: "It's part of
OL,8,FLancashire. Making proper Lancashire
OL,9,Fpies, with proper Lancashire people
OL,10,Fmaking those pies, as they have done
OL,11,Ffor generations."
